    <div class="tinker">
        <h3>Tinker: Bullet Tuning</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>In the <code>Turret_Projectile</code> prefab, tune <code>speed</code> between <code>3</code> (slow dodgeable dodgeball) and <code>15</code> (bullet-hell sniper). How does projectile speed alter the player's emotional reaction to the turret?</li>
            <li>Why does <code>Initialize</code> calculate the direction once, instead of continuously updating direction in <code>Update()</code>? What kind of weapon would you get if <code>direction</code> re-aimed toward the player every frame?</li>
